1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,780
Woman: I see that the leaves in the backyard still haven't been raked

2
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:07,080
Weren't you planning to do that?

3
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:11,270
Man: I've been working on a lecture for my English class all morning. Maybe tomorrow?

4
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:14,120
Woman: Well, it's supposed to rain tomorrow.

5
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:18,070
It might be your last chance before everything gets soggy.

6
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:22,230
Man: Good point. I'll head out after lunch. I just hope I can find the rake.

7
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:25,680
I'm pretty sure I lent it to Sarah, our neighbor last month

8
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:27,180
I'll give her a call about it.
